OL,3,AUkraine accuses Russia of targeting
OL,4,Arescue operation after 'double-tap'
OL,5,Astrike kills 72
OL,6,
OL,7,FUkrainian officials have accused Russia
OL,8,Fof targeting rescue and recovery
OL,9,Foperations two weeks after a deadly
OL,10,F"double-tap" strike at a village close
OL,11,Fto the front line killed at least 72
OL,12,Fpeople.
OL,14,FUkraine says Russia carried out two
OL,15,Fattacks in succession on a humanitarian
OL,16,Faid centre in the village of
OL,17,FKomyshuvakha on 2 November - including
OL,18,Fthe use of what it said was a 3,000kg
OL,19,F(6,600lb) aerial bomb on a shelter
OL,20,Fwhere residents had fled for safety.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
